<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Sternum Collar Set — OsTeO</title>
<meta name="description" content="Quick-release collars machined-fit to sleeve diameter, printed dense at the cam and hollow through the barrel.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bone:#EDE7D8; --bone-dim:#E1DAC6; --bone-line:#CFC6AC;
    --marrow:#15130F; --marrow-soft:#26221A; --fracture:#FF5A1F;
    --fracture-dim:#c8481b; --stone:#8C8270;
  }
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
  body{background:var(--bone);color:var(--marrow);font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',sans-serif;line-height:1.55;}
  a{color:inherit;}
  .mono{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;}
  h1,h2,h3{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.01em;}
  .wrap{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;}
  header{padding:22px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--bone-line);}
  header .wrap{max-width:960px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;}
  .back{font-size:13px;color:var(--marrow-soft);text-decoration:none;}
  .back:hover{color:var(--fracture);}
  .brand{font-weight:700;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;}
  main{padding:60px 0 100px;}
  .idx{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--fracture-dim);margin-bottom:18px;}
  h1{font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,44px);margin-bottom:14px;max-width:700px;}
  .rating{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:22px;}
  .stars{color:var(--fracture);font-size:16px;}
  .rating .count{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--stone);}
  .lede{font-size:17px;color:var(--marrow-soft);margin-bottom:36px;max-width:640px;}
  .spec-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--bone-line);border:1px solid var(--bone-line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:40px;}
  @media (max-width:640px){.spec-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}}
  .spec-grid div{background:var(--bone-dim);padding:16px 18px;}
  .spec-grid span{display:block;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--stone);letter-spacing:0.06em;margin-bottom:6px;}
  .spec-grid strong{font-size:14.5px;}
  section.block{margin-bottom:44px;}
  section.block h2{font-size:21px;margin-bottom:12px;}
  section.block p{color:var(--marrow-soft);font-size:15.5px;max-width:680px;}
  .reviews{margin-bottom:44px;}
  .review{border-top:1px solid var(--bone-line);padding:18px 0;}
  .review:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid var(--bone-line);}
  .review-head{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:8px;}
  .review-head .stars{font-size:13px;}
  .review-head .name{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--stone);}
  .review p{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--marrow-soft);}
  .cta{background:var(--marrow);color:var(--bone);border-radius:6px;padding:32px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:20px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;}
  .cta .price{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:26px;}
  .cta-actions{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--fracture);color:#fff;padding:12px 22px;border-radius:2px;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:13px;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid var(--fracture);}
  .btn-outline{background:transparent;color:var(--bone);border:1px solid #3a352a;}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="wrap">
    <a href="../index.html" class="back mono">&larr; Back to OsTeO</a>
    <span class="brand">OsTeO</span>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="idx">P-04 / BARBELL</div>
    <h1>Sternum Collar Set</h1>
    <div class="rating">
      <span class="stars">★★★★★</span>
      <span class="count mono">4.8 out of 5 (21 reviews)</span>
    </div>
    <p class="lede">Quick-release collars machined-fit to sleeve diameter, printed dense at the cam and hollow through the barrel.</p>

    <div class="spec-grid">
      <div><span>Infill</span><strong>60%</strong></div>
      <div><span>Material</span><strong>PETG-CF</strong></div>
      <div><span>Rated</span><strong>1.2mm play</strong></div>
      <div><span>Weight</span><strong>165g pair</strong></div>
      <div><span>Print time</span><strong>4 hr</strong></div>
      <div><span>Dimensions</span><strong>50mm Olympic sleeve</strong></div>
    </div>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>How it's built</h2>
      <p>The cam lever prints solid since it takes all the clamping torque; the barrel around the sleeve is where the density drops off, which is also why the pair weighs less than one steel collar.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="reviews">
      <h2 style="font-size:21px;margin-bottom:4px;">What buyers say</h2>
      <div class="review"><div class="review-head"><span class="stars">★★★★★</span><span class="name mono">A. Chen</span></div><p>Lighter than my old steel collars and the cam actually holds torque over time.</p></div>
    </div>

    <div class="cta">
      <div>
        <div class="price">$28 / pair</div>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-actions">
        <a href="../specs/osteo-sternum-collar-set-spec.pdf" class="btn btn-outline" download>Spec Sheet (PDF)</a>
        <a href="../index.html#products" class="btn">View All Equipment</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

</body>
</html>
